{"id":"H2395","lemma":"חִזְקִי","transliteration":"chizqi","sayIt":"chiz-qi","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hizki","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.17;\nson of: Elpaal (H0508);\nbrother of: Eber (H5677I), Misham (H4936), Shemed (H8106B), Beriah (H1283I), Shema (H8087I), Zebadiah (H2069H), Meshullam (H4918J), Heber (H2268J), Ishmerai (H3461), Izliah (H3152) and Jobab (H3103K)\n§ Hezeki = \"strong\"\na Benjamite, descendant of Shaaraim","glosses":["hizki"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hizki","kjv":"and Hezeki"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:17","note":"Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0508","lemma":"אֶלְפַּ֫עַל","transliteration":"elpaal","gloss":"Elpaal"},{"id":"H1283","lemma":"בְּרִיעָה","transliteration":"beriah","gloss":"Beriah"},{"id":"H2069","lemma":"זְבַדְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zevadyah","gloss":"Zebadiah"},{"id":"H2268","lemma":"חֶ֫בֶר","transliteration":"chever","gloss":"Heber"},{"id":"H5677","lemma":"עֵ֫בֶר","transliteration":"ever","gloss":"Eber"},{"id":"H4936","lemma":"מִשְׁעָם","transliteration":"misham","gloss":"Misham"},{"id":"H8106","lemma":"שֶׁ֫מֶר","transliteration":"shemer","gloss":"Shemer"},{"id":"H8087","lemma":"שֶׁ֫מַע","transliteration":"shema","gloss":"Shema"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}